  persist(
    (set) => ({
      position: { x: 0, y: 0 },
      setPosition: (position) => set({ position }),
    }),
    {
      name: 'position-storage',
      storage: createJSONStorage(() => searchParamsStorage),
    },
  ),
)
```

Next, we'll track the mouse movements inside a div and update the store with the new position.

```ts
